possible.

This hardened fork is derived from nghialuong/84Key
(https://github.com/nghialuong/84Key). Existing copyright and GPLv3
obligations from that project are preserved.


Third-party data
----------------

1. English word list
   Source: google-10000-english
   (https://github.com/first20hours/google-10000-english)
   License: Public domain / MIT.
   Used to power 84Key's automatic English-word detection.

2. Vietnamese syllable dictionary
   The Vietnamese-by-Telex syllable dictionary is generated from
   linguistic rules by this project. It is not derived from, and does
   not incorporate, any external or scraped word list.


Distribution note
-----------------

The hardened fork does not embed Sparkle or another in-app updater. The
menu update command opens the fork's GitHub Releases page only after an
explicit user action. Release-build tooling such as XcodeGen is not
linked into the application and is covered by its own upstream license.

All fork changes are distributed under GPLv3.
